  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Important note:\n- This package replaces GrapeCity.Documents.Imaging, and provides the same functionality, ensures future enhancements, and is backwards compatible with GrapeCity.Documents.Imaging. Existing subscriptions will continue to apply to this new package.\n\n# Changes since version 8.2.1:\n\n## Fixed\n- Improved handling of certain PNG images that contained minor format errors, preventing exceptions during processing. (DOC-7155)\n- Improved handling of PDFs containing embedded fonts with corrupted \"glyf\" tables to prevent rendering errors. (DOC-7159)\n- [TextLayout] Fixed an issue where Unicode characters with Vertical_Orientation = \"Tr\" were incorrectly affected by TextFormat.UprightInVerticalText, causing them not to rotate as required in vertical text. (DOC-7198)",
